window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>‘I didn’t kidnap my wife’ </p> <p>Tired of the false narratives about him, Hades agrees to his first-ever sit-down interview. To clear up the mistakes of the past and to stop people reaching out to him for all the wrong reasons. With interviewer and friend Zara asking the questions, they soon begin touching subjects he hasn’t thought about in years and prodding at wounds he’d thought long since healed. The use of [Story Mode] helps Hades portray the spirit realm to a physical audience, but he finds himself repeatedly frustrated with the situation, and by extension, his friend. He can feel Fate manipulating them behind the scenes, and soon even Zara can feel there is more going on here.</p>"; 
